abstract: |
  Grant Harvester is an autonomous, self-healing framework designed to aggregate, 
  validate, and monitor academic funding opportunities across German and European funding 
  agencies (DFG, BMBF, EU Horizon, ERC, and philanthropic foundations). It couples a 
  high-speed deterministic execution runner (System 1) with an iterative LLM reasoning and 
  reflection loop (System 2: DeepSeek Chat & DeepSeek Reasoner R1) to bypass SPA rendering 
  barriers, adapt to DOM drift, and eliminate corrupt entity extraction.